{"key": "2163ae7719267353f2c04c79daea184c", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "The main difference in the sources is price and the smart features. Get Smart is an intelligent card machine that lets you manage stock, take orders, close tabs, load a menu and issue invoices right on the terminal, and it can integrate with your business system [2]. It can also replace a computer and fiscal printer at the counter [1]. Without hitting the revenue tiers, Get Smart costs R$ 129,90/month, while Get Clássica costs R$ 79,90/month [3][5].\n\nThe sources don't describe Get Clássica's features or hardware, so I can't compare them beyond price.\n\nMISSING: Get Clássica features/specs", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011Cggf4nLXQ5BHDXeD1wSQ1", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4020, "output_tokens": 206, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "q-hard-02#0"}
{"key": "88bbc2b58a5300c083a84ad6f9841254", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"text": "Não encontrei vendas de sexta (30/10) na sua agenda dos últimos 7 dias. Os registros começam em 01/11. Estas são as vendas que aparecem:\n\n- **Pix:** 1 venda de R$ 64,00 (02/11), paga em 02/11.\n- **Débito:** 2 vendas, R$ 200,50 (02/11), pagas hoje, 03/11.\n- **Crédito:** 1 venda de R$ 500,00 (01/11), agendada para 01/12.\n- **Crédito:** 2 vendas, R$ 549,90 (02/11), agendadas para 02/12.\n\n**Antecipação:** os valores agendados são os dois de crédito, que somam R$ 1.049,90. Posso propor a antecipação do crédito. Você precisa confirmar a proposta, e depois um atendente precisa aprová-la ([policy:capabilities]). Nada é executado antes disso. Quer que eu proponha?", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011Cggf4mA6EkHhYLQ4Wcvz8", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 4180, "output_tokens": 486, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 159}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "agent", "scope": "q-hard-04#0"}
{"key": "a82d87ce4539c303ee0ada77af555384", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "response": {"content": [{"text": "Get Smart costs more and does more. It's a smart terminal that handles stock, orders, tabs, a menu and invoices, and it can connect to your business system [sup-duvidas-get-smart-10]. It can also replace a computer and fiscal printer at the counter [sup-duvidas-get-smart-08].\n\nPrice, when you don't hit the revenue tiers [prod-get-tap-03][prod-todas-as-maquininhas-04]:\n- **Get Smart:** R$ 129,90/month\n- **Get Clássica:** R$ 79,90/month\n\nThe sources don't describe Get Clássica's features or hardware, so I can't compare the two beyond price. I can pass you to a human agent if you want more detail.", "type": "text"}], "id": "msg_011Cggf4xwkMZtQ1u3c6XhLK", "model": "claude-sonnet-5-5", "role": "assistant", "stop_reason": "end_turn", "type": "message", "usage": {"cache_creation": {"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0}, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0, "inference_geo": "global", "input_tokens": 3256, "output_tokens": 239, "output_tokens_details": {"thinking_tokens": 0}, "service_tier": "standard", "speed": "standard"}}, "role": "supervisor", "scope": "q-hard-02#0"}
